    "description": "g10 12.14.04 (DAT-PAT-2). Inferno validates the Goal resources the server returns against the US Core 7.0.0 profile with the HL7 validator. The closest server-side check: the server has the profile, and a copy of the record's Goal/g10-goal-1 that claims it is accepted, which the server allows only after validating it against the profile (US Core 7.0.0 is the version loaded; a profile the server does not have would not be checked). The copy is deleted afterwards.",
